{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e238bb5989dc8cb5d2ed2a812185028b40717c62558afe5ef18ea6645813f56", "ja": "（昴とローカル番組のオーディションを受けに来た。\n料理コーナーの日替わりアシスタントに挑戦だ）", "zh": "（我和昴一起来参加地方节目的试镜。要挑战料理环节的日常助理。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6eded4ec9f9c90d98ec3aeffe9ba129b5b57d886b22ba5740382569afffa66cd", "ja": "（今のところ、昴はオーディションで\n連戦連敗だが、今日ははたして……）", "zh": "（到目前为止，昴在试镜中连战连败，不过今天究竟会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "283fd0169800e6faeddbcc8afe412f0f9355f121d7e7d01d6dd8574b6dcc1e30", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。課題だから、ささっと\n作っちゃったけど……あれでホントによかったのかな？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。因为是课题，我就赶紧做出来了……那样真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d6ad48149bac6877e741023d1fb131bbcc7477f9a17e0ba83a657b4289533a7f", "ja": "もちろん。最高に美味しそうな厚焼き玉子だったぞ！\n昴は料理が得意だって言ってたけど、本当なんだな。", "zh": "当然了。那份厚蛋烧看起来美味极了！\n昴之前说自己很擅长做饭，原来是真的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "80b685484713feaba6f771d0e920dbb4290b24d97267ba4354011d621788a298", "ja": "うちは親が自営業で忙しいからな～。\n家事は、家族みんなで当番制なんだけど……", "zh": "我爸妈是自己做生意的，平时都很忙嘛～  \n家务虽然是全家轮流负责，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "14444ee42a39cf11885cb343aaabd37d55e7bb4f90efa4b54d0f800e604f8b95", "ja": "兄ちゃんたち、料理は全然ダメでさ。\nだから、料理当番はだいたいオレになるんだ！", "zh": "哥哥们完全不会做饭。\n所以，做饭基本都是我负责！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f3d587c9cd02ff2dc4897f7e0d19af74c4a1776ad59379ddb0222bc60bfd6b29", "ja": "それで料理上手になったのか。\nお兄さんは……たしか、たくさんいるんだっけ？", "zh": "所以才练成了擅长做饭吗？\n你哥哥们……我记得，是有很多个来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1db83716124edfb0b19ec768620a55bbb812da69ebe3f77cececbe4a96bd0ba", "ja": "うん、4人！　みんな食べるのは好きだから、\n夕飯のおかずとか、毎晩取り合いになるんだよな～。", "zh": "嗯，4个！大家都很喜欢吃，所以每晚都会抢晚饭的菜呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1008_p", "source_sha256": "750e19b2b01ff0ed6eab3379f4c6374fd45567fbde5ff1fee9372aed781ecd04", "ja": "作り甲斐があっていいじゃないか。\n厚焼き玉子も、たくさん作ってきたんだろうな。", "zh": "这样才有做饭的成就感嘛。厚烧蛋卷也做过很多次了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5da7221542af2c50094ecf43aa0e1e251c35bacf4d4effacdeafac53e031e37", "ja": "うん、お弁当の定番だし、\nたぶん今までに何百個も作ってるぜ♪", "zh": "嗯，便当里经常有嘛，\n到现在为止我大概已经做过好几百个了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "a2f31865b25af53aa23008c0f068ad64baefc3c37afedf620b8c8f6088d718da", "ja": "……でもなぁ。玉子焼き作るのがウマいのと、\nアイドルとは関係ないもんな～。", "zh": "……不过啊。玉子烧做得好吃，\n和当偶像又没什么关系嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c146c16b25521bd7d72c07966b79781c434812626767d3040c24daf48f370065", "ja": "ん？　昴はそう思うのか？", "zh": "嗯？昴是这么想的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "2498a092809a563f4f14ebdef9f63908a8c9018304dc56a3f08cfd7d7da6b7bf", "ja": "え、だってそうだろ？　こういうオーディション、\nいっぱい受けてきたけど、全然合格しないし……。", "zh": "诶，因为事实就是这样吧？这种试镜我也参加过好多次，可一次都没通过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "38c146441b4c7385b76fb984c473c04865c73e170dcf971f633048d5fd8a2c0a", "ja": "今日きてる子も、みんなカワイイし。\nキラキラしてて、アイドルって感じでさ……", "zh": "今天来的孩子也都很可爱，而且都闪闪发光的，很有偶像的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "fd049eefdf35cce3f7c77c2009267bf7f224e04b4682dcdbf71113647de81873", "ja": "ん？　……あれ？", "zh": "嗯？……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2b1e137bf5d8d8a551c299419de71ac44438c808320ca546145bb7bba801d519", "ja": "昴？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "昴？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "41ea2f7f2127fd8e7b9e5654962dc9bf3da402f9f022abd5e99c931bc2fbdacd", "ja": "な、なあ、{$P$}。\nオレ、やっぱ場違いなのかな？", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}。\n我果然还是有点格格不入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "90fb072ad4007c8cc494073948eb2d1a1e546df88dc0c7b2b6df4677098107bc", "ja": "なんか……\nみんな、オレのこと見てる気がするんだけど？", "zh": "总觉得……大家好像都在看我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "eb625ae6e5fe24ad7a32a8b9d785b5c4ac66c0755ffeea59fd80b25560443ac8", "ja": "……ああ。たぶん、昴をライバルだと思ってるからじゃ\nないかな？　「本命はあの子ね」みたいな感じで。", "zh": "……啊。大概是因为她们把昴当成竞争对手了吧？感觉就像在说：“真正的目标是那孩子呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9f3be740b176832c3c013bd957923359e6392b70a36d46c8e4324b44861e2e5", "ja": "ええっ、オレが本命！？\nなんでそうなるんだ？？", "zh": "诶，我是正主！？\n怎么会变成这样啊？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1da05d13961af190c1a7006145547ca58a3ea81efe32d425c4a62c3d6b4dc912", "ja": "そりゃ、厚焼き玉子を上手に作れてたから。\n注目されて当然だよ。", "zh": "那当然是因为你能做好厚蛋烧啊。\n会受到关注也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "29cb240d93692c2218f6d9b2f93c98a6488e0c04738502de06c00fd6e85319a5", "ja": "でも、そんなの普通だろ？\nそれに、カワイイのと全然関係ないし……。", "zh": "可是，那不是很普通吗？\n而且这跟可爱完全没关系……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "144005b63c24c64c3d38c7f195e2dadd6cdc3f8e1f3aa9f3daf7681cd3f8b737", "ja": "普通じゃないって。昴のお兄さんたちみたいに、\nできない人もいるだろ？　それに……。", "zh": "这可不普通。就像昴的哥哥们那样，\n也有人做不到的吧？而且……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4f95840aae791004a8e377dc9c8c7dbd4cca889f3234a2a53a9acb50567eada9", "ja": "気づいてないみたいだけど、手際よく料理する昴の姿は\nすごくかわいくて、キラキラしてたんだ。", "zh": "你好像没注意到，熟练做饭的昴看起来特别可爱，闪闪发光的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "4f6f1896db11446da27d6adfdc1509e04b0557a75a1435509d6d67fe042f9603", "ja": "ええっ、そうなのか！？　なんで？　どこが？\n自分じゃ全然わかんなかったけど……？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗！？为什么？哪里？\n我自己完全没察觉到……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "aed7865c85a4bdba95168c950c00ec7b9ed523b7461607661e834c90d109874f", "ja": "わ、やっぱみんな見てる！　{$P$}、\nどうしよう！？　なんかオレ……ハズい～！", "zh": "哇，大家果然都在看！{$P$}，\n怎么办啊！？我总觉得……好难为情啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1026_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "aef4fb90f0cbad21b3b16552ff61b03d10703cd991ddc667d6c919dabdf030c7", "ja": "{$P$}、{$P$}！\n見てた？　オレ、マジで合格したみたい！", "zh": "{$P$}、{$P$}！\n看到了吗？我好像真的通过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a88b304ef05d0419321dda0e335cfbf6a5bd1b32a2755e6e8f58ec3dd5ab1250", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと見てたぞ！\nオーディション初合格おめでとう。やったな、昴！", "zh": "啊，我当然好好看着呢！\n恭喜你第一次通过试镜。干得漂亮，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "3659be0073340ee31d29ecaa12632584274d51d17f1ac4c4565d967bbebfeffc", "ja": "うん！！　わあ……なんか、すっげーうれしい。\n試合で勝った時と同じくらい……", "zh": "嗯！！哇……感觉特别开心。\n和比赛获胜的时候一样开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "e46d60d95c0ba4658de2e674fc78126e0a4feeb7953d7d1d256e5b2169dc08ea", "ja": "ううん、たぶん代打満塁サヨナラホームランと同じ\nくらい！　って、打ったことないけどな！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "不，大概和代打再见满垒本垒打差不多吧！\n话是这么说，但我可从来没打出来过就是了！诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "ad53b7df59738dc17881573e1c31e66da8f817e85c8a671f02f5d38a10cbe9f9", "ja": "とにかく、めちゃくちゃうれしいよ！\nありがとな、{$P$}！", "zh": "总之，真的特别开心！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_047sub_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_005_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d3c6a32f1d089567b5604497d9dc2b93b1677380b2ac5919abb277ef21b046f8", "ja": "（昴が手にしたのは、アイドルとしての初勝利。\nこれからも、この笑顔を輝かせていこう！）", "zh": "（昴获得了作为偶像的首次胜利。今后也一起让这份笑容继续闪耀吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
